       مقام" (مقام is masculine -> کا).
  UR-2 NIT     ui.common.actions.actions_for_name  "{name} کے اعمال"
       Pre-existing اعمال/اقدامات split in the ur catalogue. The new keys follow the
       nearest sibling "فائل کے اعمال" - keep as is; recorded, no change requested.

Accepted as correct with the evidence recorded in the receipt: pasted_image (mirrors
"چسپاں کردہ فائل"), image_actions.actions (mirrors "فائل کے اعمال"), and the
"{name} کے اعمال" genitive construction, which stays grammatical for any inserted user
string because Urdu marks the genitive on the possessed noun and never on the inserted
name - the same shape as the existing "{name} کے مزید اقدامات".

